outcomes and the measurement

01:05:13.690 --> 01:05:15.513
that the impact certified.

01:05:16.480 --> 01:05:20.000
I can see what you're
trying to do, I think,

01:05:20.000 --> 01:05:22.270
and it's good to have
those questionnaires,

01:05:22.270 --> 01:05:24.130
but apart from the fact that, you know,

01:05:24.130 --> 01:05:27.350
some of your conclusions
might not be that right.

01:05:27.350 --> 01:05:29.350
For instance, when you say that there

01:05:29.350 --> 01:05:34.350
