01:06:46.020 --> 01:06:51.020
retaliation games among
Palestinians around the wall.

01:06:53.040 --> 01:06:54.640
And so you could think of, you know,

01:06:54.640 --> 01:06:58.270
at the end of a football
game to make them play

01:06:58.270 --> 01:07:03.270
some games that are aimed at
the measuring corporation,

01:07:05.330 --> 01:07:10.100
propensity to retaliation,
they can measure attitudes,

01:07:10.100 --> 01:07:15.100
and those might provide
because they link up directly

01:07:15.190 --> 01:07:19.780
to behavior, to choices,

01:07:19.780 --> 01:07:24.780
You might be able to get a more
precise handle on attitudes.

01:07:26.840 --> 01:07:28.650
- Yeah, I actually think
that's a good suggestion,

01:07:28.650 --> 01:07:30.855
like lab games as being
an intermediate step

01:07:30.855 --> 01:07:34.770
between like real-world
behaviors and attitudes,

01:07:34.770 --> 01:07:36.040
like something a little bit in the middle,

01:07:36.040 --> 01:07:38.616
that's more controlled in
terms of the measurements.

01:07:38.616 --> 01:07:40.650
Yeah. But still, yeah.

01:07:40.650 --> 01:07:41.800
So, that's a good idea.

01:07:42.690 --> 01:07:44.320
- [Lushvig] Yeah. If you want,

01:07:44.320 --> 01:07:46.775
I can put you in touch
with the person because-.

01:07:46.775 --> 01:07:48.272
